  "description": "Single storey side extension over existing decking, including retention of existing walls, installation of new slim double glazed multi-paned windows with metal casements and stone surround to match existing and relocation of existing downpipe, removal of existing modern double doors and replaced with metal framed double doors. Alterations to existing roof, to include, removal of existing and creation of new hipped roof with tiles to match existing and the same ridgeline, pitch and eaves line. New full height pitched ceiling with visible painted timber rafter, finished with painted timber boards. Partially removed modern decking to facilitate the side extension. Side decking doors to be removed and replaced with multi-paned bi-fold door and replaced with new slim double glazed metal framed double doors to side decking doors",
